      "writtenOn": "2020-02-11T00:41:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added a comment about the purpose of the hint.\n\nI don\u0027t think we need to put restrictions on which cluster things get scheduled on. This is largely targeted at game engines which already take care of setting their affinities, so I suspect it won\u0027t affect their measurements much. I have also talked to the HWUI team, and it sounds like they\u0027re willing to use affinity while in this mode as well.\n\nThere\u0027s a tolerance listed for N, but maybe it\u0027s not sufficient?",
